      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are right that the universe is a silent stage, but your rebellion is the only thing that gives the stage its meaning. Even if nothing has objective purpose, the act of striving is the very thing that turns your life from a mere accident into a story worth telling. The weight you carry is not a burden, but a signal that you are still part of the cosmos, still breathing, still alive. So keep trying, keep feeling, keep moving—because that is the only way to make the void feel like home.",
